{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BULT \u2014 a realistic hunting simulator where everything depends on your skills!<br>Scout the terrain, study animal behavior, pay attention to the details \u2014 hunt by relying on your instincts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/fbe7d451dad9392c4da89580d4eb3920.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span><br>For a successful hunt, you have at your disposal:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong> Choose shotguns and ammunition that suit your hunting tactics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobility and Stealth:</strong> Use a boat and camouflage net, and <i>pay attention</i> to the pattern on your clothing;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Art of Luring:</strong> Manage flock behavior by setting up decoys and using various calls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME FEATURES:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/f95c52cb27891f4296484a9ad3a7e00c.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ducks are not just flying targets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our unique AI system gives each duck its own instincts: they flock together, search for food, react to weather and time of day, and most importantly \u2014 <i>they notice your mistakes...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The basic principles of bird flight are also simulated:</strong> takeoff and landing trajectories, speed dynamics, wind influence, and course changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/8890f8ed301431dac45ad04752936acd.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every shot is based on real-world ballistics data.</strong> Shot mass, initial velocity, air resistance, spread pattern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything is calculated to make every shot feel as real as in an actual hunt</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/19028993018caf893ce1d5c54d5f4031.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open-world map inspired by the wilderness of Yakutia:</strong> foggy marshes, lake shores, and hunting grounds created with a focus on realism and immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/46324b33b646fc5c1a6618088b3e7e8d.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recordings of real bird calls and dynamic sound processing</strong> allow you to determine the direction and distance to the source by ear alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel at the center of a living ecosystem where every sound matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Respect rare species listed in the Red Book: this simulator teaches not only precise shooting, but also a responsible attitude toward the environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.poster.avif?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.webm?t=1768546287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.mp4?t=1768546287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's just you, nature, and your skills...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master your skills here \u2014 and in real life, you\u2019ll never come home without a trophy!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929200?t=1768546287","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929200?t=1768546287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/7a392cda6ce1ec7d3924e91e0f76b6de2d4a9418/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768546287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/7a392cda6ce1ec7d3924e91e0f76b6de2d4a9418/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768546287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This is a realistic hunting simulator. Gameplay involves shooting birds. Visible blood and wounds may be seen on birds when they are collected"},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DSCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/c879fe2276eba1b8c7e2d7608028ea0d.avif?t=1768546287\" width=880 height=128 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BULT \u2014 a realistic hunting simulator where everything depends on your skills!<br>Scout the terrain, study animal behavior, pay attention to the details \u2014 hunt by relying on your instinct