p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything is calculated to make every shot feel as real as in an actual hunt</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/19028993018caf893ce1d5c54d5f4031.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open-world map inspired by the wilderness of Yakutia:</strong> foggy marshes, lake shores, and hunting grounds created with a focus on realism and immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/46324b33b646fc5c1a6618088b3e7e8d.webp?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recordings of real bird calls and dynamic sound processing</strong> allow you to determine the direction and distance to the source by ear alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel at the center of a living ecosystem where every sound matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Respect rare species listed in the Red Book: this simulator teaches not only precise shooting, but also a responsible attitude toward the environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.poster.avif?t=1768546287\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.webm?t=1768546287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.mp4?t=1768546287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's just you, nature, and y